      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should probably be changed to 3. If I\u0027m thinking about this right, I don\u0027t think 2 keys will be enough to properly rotate. This is because the staged key is always introduced as the 0 key and there would only ever be one primary key (1, 2, 3, 4, etc...). The repository would only ever consist of 0 and 1, or 0 and 2, or 0 and 3. By making 3 the default, we could ensure that we properly rotate all credentials to the new key before pruning the third key.\n\nDoes this sound right?",
